WEBVTT

00:12:29.277 --> 00:12:32.444
Here's what happens when we added
an extract from strawberries.

00:12:32.468 --> 00:12:34.976
It potently inhibits angiogenesis.

00:12:35.720 --> 00:12:37.375
And extract from soybeans.

00:12:38.725 --> 00:12:40.646
And here is a growing list

00:12:40.670 --> 00:12:44.693
of antiangiogenic foods and beverages
that we're interested in studying.

00:12:45.312 --> 00:12:47.302
For each food type,

00:12:47.326 --> 00:12:49.548
we believe that there are
different potencies

00:12:49.572 --> 00:12:51.922
within different strains and varietals.

00:12:51.946 --> 00:12:54.177
And we want to measure this because,

00:12:54.201 --> 00:12:56.415
well, while you're eating a strawberry

00:12:56.439 --> 00:12:57.916
or drinking tea,

00:12:57.940 --> 00:12:59.976
why not select the one that's most potent

00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:01.299
for preventing cancer?